69 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 52 0 R
/T (Students and staff may lose personal belongings such as IDs, school materials, gadgets, and other items while inside the campus. When lost and found information is posted only through Facebook Groups or messages, it can be difficult to find older posts and identify the current status of an item. )
/E (Students and staff may lose personal belongings such as IDs, school materials, gadgets, and other items while inside the campus. When lost and found information is posted only through Facebook Groups or messages, it can be difficult to find older posts and identify the current status of an item. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
70 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 52 0 R
/T (Local Directory - Lost & Found provides one website where users can view lost and found listings, search by item details, upload photos, and check the reported location. A map can help users understand where an item was lost or found, while an upload service can store item photos. )
/E (Local Directory - Lost & Found provides one website where users can view lost and found listings, search by item details, upload photos, and check the reported location. A map can help users understand where an item was lost or found, while an upload service can store item photos. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
